Hi Gabrielle,

If you use this statement:

data[1:3][data[1:3]>1]<-1

You are transforming your abundance data in occupancy. Really you want to do that?

If you delete that line, you can get e.g for fm1:

> backTransform(fm1, type="state")

Backtransformed linear combination(s) of Abundance estimate(s)

Estimate   SE LinComb (Intercept)

     3.33 2.41     1.2           1

Transformation: exp

> backTransform(fm1, type="det")

Backtransformed linear combination(s) of Detection estimate(s)

Estimate     SE LinComb (Intercept)

    0.102 0.0744   -2.18           1

Transformation: logistic

Best,

Jose

