Subject: Occupancy modelling with 2 seasons (not dynamic)
Message-ID: <lDAZPHhlvQY.QVIh_BUiCAAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/lDAZPHhlvQY/m/QVIh_BUiCAAJ>
