> Note that the analysis with occu assumes that psi1 = psi2.  But if one would want to have the explicit restriction such that psi1 = psi2 (to match the closure assumption you make) with colext for the estimation process (and not just the data generation process), then the likelihood for that model would need to be constructed and then maximized.  I don't believe that colext allows for such restrictions on the parameters.
>
> Jim

